product-rating (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The free text search of the catalogue finds products by the name of
    their categories as well, whole or in part, ignoring case and
    diacritics: "thermo" finds everything filed under "Thermomix".
  * Every word of a search term is matched on its own, short words
    included, so a brand and part of a name find their product.

 -- roemer2201 <roemer2201@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

product-rating (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Entries without an EAN: dishes and recipes as well as products without
    a barcode (bakery, counter, market) can be added from the scan page,
    rated, photographed and given a price, which means cost per portion
    for a dish. The catalogue marks them and filters by kind; a product
    without a barcode can get its EAN once, later.
  * Migration 0010 rebuilds the products table. A snapshot of the database
    is written before migrations run, and they are rolled back as a whole
    if a reference would break.
  * Categories are a list of their own, kept in the administration, instead
    of free text on each product. Migration 0009 takes over the existing
    values, merging spellings that differ only in case.
  * The catalogue search can scan a barcode, and the catalogue reloads when
    it is pulled down. The scanner starts the camera from inside its field.
  * Export format version 3 carries the kind and the id of every entry.
  * No change to the installation layout or to the configuration.

 -- roemer2201 <roemer2201@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

product-rating (0.2.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The header no longer cuts off the account name on a narrow screen. The
    label and the name may now sit on two lines, and the name is shortened
    only when it is too long for a line of its own.
  * The rating scale closes with the number of the top rating, the way it
    opens with a zero. Both rows the scale wraps into on a phone are the
    same length, and a tap on that number gives the full ten stars.
  * No change to the installation layout, to the configuration or to the
    database.

